    aiContent: {
      difficulty: {
        easy: 'Bids Alliance only with 3+ trumps. Plays highest card to win or lowest to follow. Ignores matador hold-back privilege.',
        medium: 'Evaluates hand strength for Solo vs Alliance. Tracks trump distribution. Uses matador hold-back when beneficial.',
        hard: 'Models opponent hands from play. Coordinates with secret partner in Alliance. Optimizes trump sequencing and Premiers/Matador bonuses.',
      },
      considerations: [
        'AI must handle inverted red-suit ranking and the three permanent matadors (Spadille, Manille, Basta).',
        'In Alliance, partner identity is secret until the called King is played; AI must infer from play.',
        'Complex settlement (Remise, Codille, Premiers, Matadors) requires accurate trick and bonus tracking.',
      ],
